# Realistic Uncertainty Scenario: Ad Hoc Rules in SmartHomeEnv.channel_change

## Uncertainty Manifestation 1: Channel Number Prefix Requirements

**Description**:
The channel_change function requires channel numbers to follow a specific format where certain channel ranges must be prefixed with specific characters. For example, premium channels (300-399) must be prefixed with "P-", sports channels (400-499) must be prefixed with "S-", and movie channels (500-599) must be prefixed with "M-". These prefixes are required for proper channel routing but are not intuitive to developers who expect to simply provide numeric channel values.

